Vendored third-party dependency, moved to soroban-sdk 29
========================================================

  Library:  registry-traits 0.1.0 (Rust, no_std)
  Upstream: https://github.com/stellar-registry/contracts
  Commit:   884c1f94cbfcce249a5b8fa6325fb9052a90bd61
            ("fix(registry-traits): raise soroban-sdk ceiling <27 -> <28
            (perch is on 27.0.2)"), on the unmerged branch
            feat/registry-importable-stateless-deploy (PR #33)
  Path:     contracts/registry-traits
  License:  Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE)
  Used by:  perch-stateless-registry (the registry `#[contracttrait]`s)

Why vendored
------------
registry-traits is unpublished and exists only on that unmerged branch,
whose soroban-sdk range is >=25.3.1, <28; the repository's main branch
(soroban-sdk 28) does not contain it (checked 2026-11-03). Perch builds with
soroban-sdk 29.0.1 / soroban-env-host 29.0.1, and a crate that requires
another soroban-sdk major cannot share its types, so this copy is built as a
path dependency with the soroban-sdk pin moved. No change was proposed
upstream.

Upstream files
--------------
Every file is upstream's bytes at the commit above except the three named
under the delta. UPSTREAM.sha256 lists the sha256 of every vendored file at
that commit, with LICENSE taken from the repository root. Not vendored: the
rest of the repository.

SDK 29 delta
------------
Cargo.toml:

  - the soroban-sdk dependency `{ version = ">=25.3.1, <28", features =
    ["alloc"] }` became `{ version = "29.0.1", features = ["alloc"] }`, and
    the comment above it, which explained the range, became one line naming
    this NOTICE;
  - the `[dev-dependencies]` table was dropped (the tests are not vendored).

src/registry/wasm.rs: `#[contracttype(export = false)]` became
`#[contracttype]`. soroban-sdk 28 removed the `export` argument (a compile
error) and always strips spec entries a contract's interface does not reach.

src/registry/contract.rs: the two `deployer.deploy_v2(wasm_hash, ..)` calls
became
`deployer.deploy_contract(soroban_sdk::ContractExecutable::Wasm(wasm_hash),
..)`. soroban-sdk 28 deprecates `deploy_v2`; both invoke the host's
`create_contract_with_constructor` with the same arguments.

Updating
--------
Replace the directory with the new upstream files, re-apply the delta above,
regenerate UPSTREAM.sha256 from the unmodified upstream files, and update
this NOTICE. crates/integration-tests/tests/vendor.rs requires every
vendored file other than Cargo.toml to hash to UPSTREAM.sha256 (after
reversing any source delta above) and the directory to hold nothing else but
NOTICE and UPSTREAM.sha256, so no other upstream byte can change unnoticed.
